ainst a futuristic, cyan-blue gradient background with circuit lines. At the top, 'MOBILE CLIENT \(Guard App\)' icon shows sub-modules: high-precision 'GPS GEOFENCING \(20m-50m\)', 'ANTI-SPOOFING PROTOCOLS' \(mock detection, root block\), 'LIVE SELFIE VER\
IFICATION' \(timestamp, watermark\), and 'OFFLINE MODE' \(encrypted sync\). It links to the central 'BACKEND & SERVICES' microservice hub \(API, Security, Logic\) and 'DATA LAYER' \(PostgreSQL PostGIS, AWS S3\). To the right, 'ADMIN & MONITORING PORTAL \(\
Web\)' displays 'LIVE MAP VIEW' with guard markers, 'FLAGGED INCIDENT LOGS', 'AUTOMATED ALERTS' \(WhatsApp, Telegram icons\), and 'HRIS & PAYROLL INTEGRATION' \(REST API\). A clean process flow 'PHASED DEPLOYMENT TIMELINE' spans the lower half: Phase 1 \(\
1-2 Wks\): Requirements & Design -> Phase 2 \(3-5 Wks\): Mobile Dev -> Phase 3 \(5-7 Wks\): Backend & Dashboard -> Phase 4 \(8-9 Wks\): HR Integration & UAT -> Phase 5 \(10 Wks\): Rollout & Training. On the far right, a vertical column list summary 'CORE \
ADVANTAGES': Verifiable Presence, Tamper Resistance, Immediate Supervision, Operational Continuity. The infographic is clean, visually coherent, and professional, using modern icons, glowing accents, and clear typography, without extraneous disclaimers. T\
iny data stream animations and geometric patterns subtly decorate the background., AI generated, AI generated)/K 0/P 2037 0 R/Pg 30 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>
