fessional typography. All main sections from <IMAGE_0> remain in their exact positions and order. The "MOBILE CLIENT \(Guard App\)" box, icons \(Phone, Map Pin, Shield, Camera, Cloud Sync\), and text descriptions are updated to the dark blue theme. The ce\
nter "BACKEND & SERVICES / DATA LAYER" box and icons are now a refined electric blue and silver, matching the theme. The "ADMIN & MONITORING PORTAL \(Web\)" box and all its sub-elements \(Laptop, Live Map View with pins, Flagged Incident Logs, Automated A\
lerts, WhatsApp/Telegram icons, and HRIS/Payroll Integration\) are integrated into the dark blue aesthetic. The "PHASED DEPLOYMENT TIMELINE" section, with its 5-phase structure and connecting arrows, is present, now using dark blue and electric blue for b\
oxes and text. The "CORE ADVANTAGES" vertical panel is also integrated into the dark blue theme. All specific numbers \(20m-50m, 1-2 Wks, etc.\) and technical text are preserved perfectly and are highly legible. A clean border with futuristic details fram\
es the entire dark blue and electric blue infographic. The style remains professional, detailed, and data-driven., AI generated, AI generated)/K 2/P 2039 0 R/Pg 30 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>
