<</Alt(A modern digital infographic banner in a corporate presentation style, titled 'SMART GUARD SYSTEM: TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE & DEPLOYMENT' in sleek white font within a top title bar. The banner is composed of clean, dark blue and cyan-colored UI cards connec\
ted by glowing blue lines against a dark technical background with circuit and city network patterns. At the top, several horizontal cards define the main system components. From left to right: 1. A card for 'MOBILE GUARD APP', with icons and labels: 'GPS\
 GEOFENCING' with a pin and range circle, 'LIVE SELFIE VERIFICATION' with a smiling person in a viewfinder, and 'OFFLINE MODE SUPPORT' with a cloud icon and data arrows. 2. A large 'SECURE API BACKEND' card, showing a 'NODE.JS SERVER' with security icons \
\(locks, shield\) and API endpoint symbols. This card connects down to: 3. A 'DATABASE LAYER' card, featuring a 'POSTGRESQL POSTGIS' icon, showing gears, data stacks, and a map icon indicating geographic data. 4. A 'WEB ADMIN PORTAL' card, depicting a mon\
itor and tablet with a 'LIVE MONITORING MAP' with real-time guard locations, 'INSTANT ALERT DISPATCH' with notification symbols \(bell, message, phone\), and 'HRIS INTEGRATION' with a handshake and system gear. Arrows and glowing data streams indicate the\
 architecture. Below these cards is a clean, modern 'PHASED DEPLOYMENT TIMELINE' presented as a horizontal timeline with five distinct numbered phases and brief titles: '1. PLANNING & DESIGN', '2. DEVELOPMENT', '3. INTEGRATION TESTING', '4. UAT & TRAINING\
', and '5. GO-LIVE & SUPPORT'. Each phase has a distinct colored icon and date placeholders. The entire infographic is professional, with smooth gradients, neon blue and cyan highlights, and floating technological elements like data points and network nod\
es. No disclaimer lines or extraneous text., AI generated, AI generated)/K 32/P 2002 0 R/Pg 27 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>
